@Patient_service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5072
@patientId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Listar pacientes
GET {{Patient_service_HostAddress}}/api/patients
Accept: application/json

### Cadastrar paciente
POST {{Patient_service_HostAddress}}/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Pereira",
  "cpf": "987.654.321-00",
  "email": "carlos.pereira@email.com",
  "phone": "(43) 98888-7777",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-20",
  "status": "ativo",
  "insuranceName": "Unimed",
  "insuranceCardNumber": "0001234"
}

### Buscar paciente por Id — substitua @patientId pelo id retornado no cadastro
GET {{Patient_service_HostAddress}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Accept: application/json

### Editar paciente
PUT {{Patient_service_HostAddress}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Pereira Lima",
  "email": "carlos.lima@email.com",
  "phone": "43988887777",
  "birthDate": "1990-05-20",
  "status": "ativo"
}

### Remover paciente
DELETE {{Patient_service_HostAddress}}/api/patients/{{patientId}}

###
